The frontend and build scripts derive from the nes-super-mario-bros static
Linux experiment. Build tools, tests and documentation use Apache License 2.0;
see LICENSE. The frontend sources in static/ use GNU GPL version 2; see
static/LICENSE. No Nintendo ROM or game artwork is included.

The build downloads libretro FCEUmm and its libretro-common support sources,
musl, Xorg protocols, libXau, libxcb, xcb-proto, PulseAudio, libsndfile, Wayland,
wayland-protocols, libffi, libxkbcommon and Meson. Exact source URLs, revisions
and SHA-256 checksums are recorded in static/*.lock and uv.lock. Each upstream project
retains its own copyright and license terms. Runtime license notices are
copied to dist/licenses during the build.

FCEUmm is GPL-2.0. PulseAudio client and libsndfile components use LGPL terms.
Musl, X11, Wayland, libffi and libxkbcommon use permissive licenses. Retain
matching source, modifications, build instructions and required notices when
redistributing a compiled executable. A supplied cartridge has its own rights
and is excluded from this repository by default.
